---
const releases = 'https://github.com/Spectrewolf8/RoverTools-Releases/releases';
---

<section class="section dl" id="download">
	<div class="wrap dl-inner">
		<p class="eyebrow reveal">Download</p>
		<h2 class="section-title reveal">Your clipboard is about to get a memory.</h2>
		<p class="section-lead reveal center">
			Free, no account, nothing to configure. Install it, copy something, press
			Ctrl+Shift+V.
		</p>
		<div class="dl-cards">
			<div class="dl-card reveal">
				<h3>Windows</h3>
				<p>Installer for Windows 10 and 11. Installs per user, no admin needed.</p>
				<a class="btn btn-primary" href={`${releases}/latest`}>Download for Windows</a>
			</div>
			<div class="dl-card reveal">
				<h3>Linux</h3>
				<p>deb, rpm and AppImage builds. X11 is the smoothest ride, and Wayland works with a small setup step.</p>
				<div class="dl-row">
					<a class="btn btn-ghost" href={`${releases}/latest`}>Get a Linux build</a>
					<a class="dl-note-link" href="/docs/linux/">Linux notes</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p class="dl-note reveal">
			Updates arrive inside the app, signature-checked, and never install without
			asking. A beta channel is one switch away in Settings.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.dl {
		background:
			radial-gradient(60% 80% at 50% 110%, rgba(255, 62, 28, 0.13), transparent 70%),
			var(--bg);
	}

	.dl-inner {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.section-lead.center {
		margin-left: auto;
		margin-right: auto;
	}

	.dl-cards {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 24rem));
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1.2rem;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.dl-card {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 1.25rem 1.3rem;
	}

	.dl-card h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
	}

	.dl-card p {
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
	}

	.dl-row {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.dl-note-link {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.dl-note {
		margin: 2.2rem auto 0;
		max-width: 34rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.dl-cards {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
